                <pb facs="0553" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg479"/>

                <head>No. 8.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Lisbon</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-08">February 8,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Horatio Perry, American Legation, Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>Have you precise information as to rebel cruiser reported at Ferrol and Vigo? Are
                    you sure as to Shenandoah?</p>
                <p>The Sacramento entered here partially disabled, en route to Vigo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HARVEY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
